flowchart LR
  A[Admit objective, plan, scope, route] --> B[Allocate run, capacity, worktree, session]
  B --> C[Advertise and approve plan]
  C --> D[Persistent execution]
  D --> E[Question / approval / wait / checkpoint]
  E -->|answer, message, nudge, claim| D
  E --> R[Reconnect / preserve / stop / reap]
  D --> F[Capture deliverable commit and result pin]
  F --> G[Verify in fresh worktree]
  G --> H[Independent review]
  H --> I[Adopt / integrate]
  I --> J[Close resources and emit receipt]
